      `proceedings have been instituted in a prescribed foreign country and have not been concluded (where applicable)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `paragraph 6(2) of the Third Schedule applies` IS A BOOLEAN
      contents IS A `o 53 r 11(1) what the supporting affidavit says`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 53 r 11(1) the application is filed and served with a supporting affidavit as it must be` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`it is an application for a restraint order under paragraph 7(1) of the Third Schedule or a charging order under paragraph 8(1) of that Schedule`)
