        IF     `it is filed and served with a supporting affidavit`
           AND ((NOT (`proceedings have been instituted in a prescribed foreign country and have not been concluded (where applicable)`)) OR contents's `o 53 r 11(1)(a) it states that proceedings have been instituted in a prescribed foreign country and have not been concluded, and the grounds for believing that a foreign confiscation order may be made`)
